FROM docker.io/daviau/gbdk-dev:4.6.0@sha256:cf2db1136d0b3219c19f45c137bf57578da2c4b5deec2dd1bcf2e3108af60ee0

ARG DEV_UID=1000
ARG DEV_GID=1000

USER root
# Match the host account so builds in the bind-mounted folder stay writable.
RUN set -eu; \
    if [ "$DEV_UID:$DEV_GID" != "1000:1000" ]; then \
        if ! getent group "$DEV_GID" >/dev/null; then groupadd --gid "$DEV_GID" dev-host; fi; \
        usermod --uid "$DEV_UID" --gid "$DEV_GID" dev; \
        chown -R "$DEV_UID:$DEV_GID" /home/dev; \
    fi
USER dev
